    * geometry / meshes : real jetauto_description (base, 4 mecanum wheels, shells)
    * mecanum wheels    : friction-based with 12 modeled rollers each (no kinematic
                          plugin) -> holonomic strafe emerges from physics
    * sensors           : RPLIDAR A1 (/scan), MPU-6050 IMU (/imu/data_raw), Astra (/cam_1)
